

    ----------------------------------*--------------------------------
                  The BABYLON PROJECT System Configuration
    -------------------------------------------------------------------

      This system is operated on the following equipment / software:

      1. Amiga 3000/25
      2. 13 megs 32 bit RAM
      3. 565 Megabytes of HardDrive space
      4. Genuine HAYES 14.4 External Modem
      5. RGB Monitor
      6. ShadoeGate BBS System BBS Software
      7. AmiTCP/IP v2.3 net software
      8. AmigaUUCP v1.17 UUCP software
      9. Amiga 500 w/ 1meg/ECS chipset (UUCP machine)
      10. External 14.4 & 2400 modems (UUCP support)
      11. Seemingly endless spools of cables :)
      12. 1 very dedicated (or maybe insane...) SysOp  :)
